  "Description": "<img width=\"25%\" src=\"https://gtif-ukif.github.io/gtif-ukif-client/assets/ucl-logo.webp\">\n\nPredicted SPEI (Standardised Precipitation and Evapotranspiration) is shown for 2 drought years: August 2025 and August 2022 and one non-drought year: August 2020. The predicted SPEI was created using NASA-VIIRS LST, ERA5-land soil ET + preciptation and downscaled to 10m from 1km using interpolated NDVI which takes months of spectral albedo derived NDVI from S2GM to ensure there are no data gaps. A 10m crop-type map was specially created for the UK and merged with EU38 equivalent to explore how drought affects different crop-types.",
